---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { AUTHOR } from '../consts';
---

<Base
	title="About"
	description="Biology and Computer Science teacher in Hong Kong, now an infrastructure engineer in Britain working on endpoint management, identity, security and automation."
>
	<h1>About</h1>

	<p>
		I'm {AUTHOR.name}. I taught Biology and Computer Science for some years in Hong Kong, before
		changing career into IT here in Britain.
	</p>

	<p>
		These days I'm the infrastructure guy, and enjoying it. I support modern workplace technologies
		across endpoint management, identity and security — and, more importantly to me, the automation
		that ties all of it together, mostly written in Bash and Python.
	</p>

	<p>
		This site is dedicated to sharing the findings I pick up along the way — the small ones
		included. I have taken a great deal from the community over the years, and I hope this puts
		something back.
	</p>

	<h2>Elsewhere</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><a href={AUTHOR.github} rel="me">GitHub</a></li>
		<li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a></li>
	</ul>
</Base>
